                },
                {
                  "id": "h-supplier-matters",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Truck Parts Reliability Depends on the Supplier",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "supplier-matters"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-supplier-matters-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even the best parts won't perform well if they're improperly matched or installed. That's why working with a trusted parts supplier matters just as much as the part itself. At Sun State International, our parts team understands how real-world trucking works. We help customers:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-supplier-matters-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Match parts to specific truck applications"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Choose between OEM and high-quality aftermarket options"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Avoid compatibility issues that cause premature failures"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce downtime by getting the right part quickly"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-supplier-matters-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This consultative approach helps operators make confident decisions instead of costly guesses.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-parts-and-service",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When Parts and Service Work Better Together",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "parts-and-service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-parts-and-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "There's a strong connection between parts selection and service quality. When parts and service teams work together, problems are diagnosed more accurately and repairs last longer. Reliable service backed by quality semi truck replacement parts means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-parts-and-service-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Faster turnaround times"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fewer comebacks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Better preventive maintenance outcomes"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-parts-and-service-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This integrated approach is especially valuable for fleets managing multiple trucks and tight schedules. If you're ready to improve truck parts reliability and reduce unexpected repairs, our experienced technicians are here to help.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/avoid-cheap-parts-how-to-find-reliable-parts-for-semi-trucks/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International service technician installing quality replacement parts on an International truck engine"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-smart-choices",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Smart Parts Choices Pay Off",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "smart-choices"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-smart-choices-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The hidden costs of cheap parts don't always show up right away, but they always show up eventually. Choosing the right parts for semi-trucks means balancing cost, quality, and application with long-term performance in mind.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-smart-choices-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "By understanding the differences between OEM and aftermarket options, working with knowledgeable professionals, and prioritizing reliability, you protect more than just your truck; you protect your livelihood. That's the kind of straightforward, dependable support Sun State International is built to deliver, mile after mile.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
